====================================================================================================
A2.2  identities: zero-carry, repetition (cyclotomic cofactor), the a = p-2 family mod 5    [t=113s]
====================================================================================================
  c_w = -(2^p - 3^a) + sum_j 3^(a+j-1-z_j) 2^(z_j)  (zeros z_1<...<z_z) and c_w = 2^(s_(a-1)) (mod 3): 8166 words
  c_(u^d) = c_u * (2^p - 3^a)/(2^(p/d) - 3^(a/d)) for every d-fold repetition: 148 cases
  a = p-2, 5 | D (exactly the odd p): N_5 = {0} for p in 5..61 (29 gates); 2/3 = -1 mod 5, so c_w = 3^a((-1)^z1 + 3(-1)^z2) != 0 mod 5

